{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"big\": \"X\",\n    \"small\": \"X\",\n    \"core\": \"Y\",\n    \"concise\": \"Y\",\n    \"human\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\",\n    \"load\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"big、small：X 的大字直接交代人物的处境、原因和心理转折，单看大字也能串起故事；小字感受大多是可跳读的补充。Y 的重点词脱离周围小字后，在 S01、S10 等屏上不够自足。core、concise：core 判 Y，它更明确地把亲密带来的幸福、时间流逝和预先感到失去的痛楚连在一起；concise 也判 Y，X 在 S01、S03、S05、S10 等处多次用感受重复大字已经表达的害怕、念头消退或放松。human、fine、load：human 判 X，Y 有“像一句想了很久的话”的悬接不明、“忘了藏好喜欢”“不安还没回答”“开阔的尺度”等具体搭配或语气问题；X 整体更口语。fine 判 X，X 的感受更多落在话到嘴边、手不自觉收紧、白天亲近而夜里独处泛酸等具体体验，Y 则有不少感受转去描写歌声、声线和颤音。load 判 X，X 的大块虽然偏长，但字号统一、意群边界清楚，数量与停留时间基本相称；Y 在整句中穿插多处放大词，重点较密，视觉上需要不断切换注意位置。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "36c648d3-19a2-4bc5-8a24-9e96c3ceb233", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261111T195737551300Z", "elapsed_seconds": 462.969, "completed_utc": "2026-11-11T20:05:20.523788+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "6ee470f24c87706d2998679652c969cb06e1c1832c8bedd8050a8096e625358a", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tool